cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the upstream frameworks if used in research."
title: "G1-DynamicParkour: Evidence-Driven Dynamic-Platform Parkour in Simulation"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "G1-DynamicParkour contributors"
version: "2.2.0-rc.1"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Local public-release candidate for a Unitree G1 simulation research project.
  PPO subpolicies and a deterministic coordinator execute two real jumps,
  with separate contact and airborne-event audits. V3 features are excluded.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - humanoid robotics
  - MuJoCo
  - reproducibility
